{title: House of the Rising Sun}
{artist: Traditional}
{key: Am}
{time: 6/8}
{tempo: 72}
{difficulty: beginner}
{strumming: Arpeggiate: bass - 3 - 2 - 1 - 2 - 3 per bar}
{comment: Folk melody, public domain. One chord per bar of 6/8.}

{start_of_verse: Verse}
| Am | C | D | F |
| Am | C | E | E |
| Am | C | D | F |
| Am | E | Am | E |
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Repeat the verse for each verse. Practice the E to Am change on its own first.}
